        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I volunteer at AHT and wow I can tell you it's a paradise over there. The horses are super well socialized. The staff is fantastic. They take such good care of the animals.\nLove🌻",
        "time": 1759798226,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mega Bear",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113531208738365574780/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBRLxQPjD0nbYd0WmOKhwbJvHBfmChCre-Wdp56XjTrQKZxG8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "We went to an open house today at this wonderful retreat for old or offend hourses. What a great day we had. Not only did we get time to spend time with the horses in residence there, but we were treated to a great wealth of information about every hourse residing in this great sanctuary for retired hourses. Mike and all of the volunteers working there made sure you understood the goal of the existence of this wonderful place. Go, visit, learn the story behind the existince of the non profit sanctuary  and enjoy a hour or so of the bliss that comes with the presents of a hourse close to your body. Go, support, and enjoy what comes with being close to such a majestic animal as a hourse. We loved our time at , a hourse tail. We will definitely be returning soon. David and Darlene. Such a great experience!!.",
        "time": 1749384600,
        "translated": false
      },
