      },
      {
        "author_name": "Zarasor",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102241061198013469136/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmLw9-yrcsFmwiD0GEGjwusQuG4G3f6aqXKWznGJas5vgblGJWYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Great place for kids and families to volunteer and learn more horses and farm life. I highly recommend this place if your looking for a place for your kids to get their hands a little dirty and learn a little about hard work, responsibility and respect. All this, And you get to spend time with the wonderful animals that horses are. It's a registered charity too so you donations are tax deductible. The smiles on my kid's faces says it all though.",
        "time": 1541997357,
        "translated": false
